1
00:00:00,233 --> 00:00:01,432
This is the live app,

2
00:00:01,452 --> 00:00:03,014
on Monad testnet.

3
00:00:03,275 --> 00:00:05,054
These are Monad's real blocks,

4
00:00:05,074 --> 00:00:06,285
going from proposed,

5
00:00:06,305 --> 00:00:07,829
to voted, to finalized,

6
00:00:07,849 --> 00:00:10,421
about three hundred milliseconds apart.

7
00:00:11,421 --> 00:00:12,748
The feed is posts,

8
00:00:12,768 --> 00:00:14,620
and every post is a market.

9
00:00:14,753 --> 00:00:15,557
On a laptop,

10
00:00:15,577 --> 00:00:18,591
Monad's live activity sits right beside it.

11
00:00:19,591 --> 00:00:20,781
No wallet yet?

12
00:00:20,856 --> 00:00:22,915
One passkey prompt makes an account,

13
00:00:22,935 --> 00:00:24,958
through Mera. No seed phrase,

14
00:00:24,978 --> 00:00:26,528
and no extension.

15
00:00:27,528 --> 00:00:29,308
Tap Buy. The sheet gives a new

16
00:00:29,328 --> 00:00:31,722
wallet testnet MON from Juno's faucet,

17
00:00:31,742 --> 00:00:33,325
right here. Pick a size,

18
00:00:33,345 --> 00:00:34,419
and buy.

19
00:00:38,926 --> 00:00:40,764
Executed in one round trip,

20
00:00:40,784 --> 00:00:42,110
and final a moment later,

21
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:43,402
measured on Monad.

22
00:00:43,535 --> 00:00:45,315
It cost a fraction of a cent,

23
00:00:45,335 --> 00:00:47,451
next to the same gas on Ethereum.

24
00:00:47,471 --> 00:00:49,007
And every receipt is a card you

25
00:00:49,027 --> 00:00:50,182
can post.

26
00:00:51,182 --> 00:00:53,380
The passkey itself is checked by Monad's

27
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:55,797
own P256 precompile.

28
00:00:56,912 --> 00:00:59,066
This post filled its curve.

29
00:00:59,199 --> 00:01:01,780
It graduated into its own Kuru market,

30
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:03,138
seeded from its raise,

31
00:01:03,158 --> 00:01:05,228
and its trades now fill on Kuru's

32
00:01:05,248 --> 00:01:06,404
order book.

33
00:01:09,174 --> 00:01:11,592
The same wallet trades perps on Perpl,

34
00:01:11,612 --> 00:01:14,289
with Agora's AUSD as margin.

35
00:01:14,364 --> 00:01:17,200
One tap brings ten thousand test AUSD

36
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:18,782
from Agora's faucet.

37
00:01:18,915 --> 00:01:20,973
Deposit it into a Perpl account,

38
00:01:20,993 --> 00:01:22,958
open a two times long on Bitcoin,

39
00:01:22,978 --> 00:01:23,995
and close it.

40
00:01:24,348 --> 00:01:26,360
Every step is a real transaction on

41
00:01:26,380 --> 00:01:27,396
Monad.

42
00:01:29,363 --> 00:01:31,595
Pre-IPO trackers, like OpenAI,

43
00:01:31,615 --> 00:01:33,232
are marked against Tessera,

44
00:01:33,252 --> 00:01:35,299
and their net asset value is attested

45
00:01:35,319 --> 00:01:38,576
on chain by a Chainlink CRE workflow.

46
00:01:40,725 --> 00:01:43,433
Juno. Every post is a market,

47
00:01:43,453 --> 00:01:45,294
live on Monad testnet.
